    "date": 1670850293,
    "caption": "Friends, check out how AI powered app offered by IntelliSense-LAB optimizes stockpiles and inventories for the mining sector.\n\nStockpile & Inventory Optimization application provides near real-time, 3D ore control models of stockpiles to optimize mine planning and mineral processing.\n\nThe Stockpile & Inventory Optimization App helps to:\n- Optimize throughput and recovery with improved blending decisions\n- Eliminate reclaim errors by knowing exactly where your material is, and the exact residence time\n- Avoid value destruction caused by dumping errors\n- Decrease waste and risk caused by material remaining in-situ for longer than is safe\n- Stockpile & Inventory Optimization application is helping deliver over $100M per year in value creation at a South African Platinum Mine\n\nThe Technological Development Center «IntelliSense-Lab» was created jointly with Tech Garden (Kazakhstan) and Intellisense.io (UK) to optimize the production processes of the mining and metallurgical complex using an artificial intelligence platform as part of the Industry 4.0 program\n\nTechnology Partner-IntelliSense.io IntelliSense.io is the first AI company to develop and implement real-time process optimization applications in industry through the “brains.app” technology platform. IntelliSense.io currently works with the largest mining companies around the world - in Latin America, Central Asia, Australia and Africa. IntelliSense.io is headquartered in Cambridge\n\nLearn more: https://techgarden.kz/intellisense 🔗\n\nActive link is in bio 🦾",
